    "caption": "Did you realise this about Tom Holland’s eyebrows? 👀\n\nWhen @kullanici reached out to ask about Tom Holland’s signature brows, of course I had to share how to get the look! \n\nWhile threading will always be the absolute best and most precise removal method for brow hair, I know accessing a qualified brow threader isn’t always an option for everyone.\n\nIf you’re managing your shape at home with tweezers, the secret is editing rather than reshaping. You want to preserve his signature natural density while keeping the tail tidy.\n\nHere I share the exact advice I gave Esquire on: \n1️⃣ Where not to pluck so you don’t destroy your natural shape\n2️⃣ Mapping your brows before touching a pair of tweezers\n3️⃣ Why “imperfect” character brows win every time\n\nLink in bio for full article.\n\n#BrowbyJai #BBBLondon #tomholland #browexpert #spiderman",
